5
00:00:08,229 --> 00:00:08,853
Maan lo,

6
00:00:08,873 --> 00:00:10,912
aap har mahine ₹5,000 invest

7
00:00:10,932 --> 00:00:11,900
karte ho.

8
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:12,915
5 saal baad:

9
00:00:12,935 --> 00:00:13,997
₹3 lakh daale,

10
00:00:14,017 --> 00:00:15,959
value hai kareeb ₹4 lakh.

11
