Kaafi slow lagta hai na?

12
00:00:18,220 --> 00:00:19,342
10 saal baad:

13
00:00:19,362 --> 00:00:20,484
₹6 lakh daale,

14
00:00:20,504 --> 00:00:22,619
value kareeb ₹11.5 lakh.

15
00:00:22,639 --> 00:00:23,726
20 saal baad:

16
